<mj-text><p>Two years ago we sent the first issue to 212 people. This letter is for the founding members who made the second year possible.</p></mj-text>
<mj-raw rc-preview="end"><!-- rc:preview-end --></mj-raw>
<mj-text><p>Here is what we built with your support, and what comes next.</p><p>Read on Substack: <a href="https://acmeweekly.substack.com/p/hello-from-acme-weekly?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web">https://acmeweekly.substack.com/p/hello-from-acme-weekly?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</a></p></mj-text>
